Icon license — Pustman `assets/icons/`

Every SVG in this directory is derived from the Lucide icon set
(https://lucide.dev), which is released under the ISC license below. Lucide's
24x24 stroke art is mapped into Pustman's icon geometry (16x16 viewBox, 1.2px
stroke, content in a 12x12 inner box; `.agents/skills/rust-gpui-ui-ux/references/
design-system.md` §6) by `translate(0.8 0.8) scale(0.6)` on the original paths —
no paths are hand-drawn. The mapping and the trimmed per-file license comment
were produced mechanically from `lucide-static` v0.552.0; the artwork itself is
Lucide's.

These files are shape references for rendering only. Nothing here is Postman
artwork, branding or layout, and `docs/postman_redesign_pack/` is never copied
into this repository.

